BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165301@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261005T135909Z
DTSTART:20261023T160000Z
DTEND:20261023T170000Z
SUMMARY:Office Hours with ISO-NE External Affairs
LOCATION:Teams
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England’s (ISO-NE) External Affairs department will host virtual office hours on October 23. Following a brief discussion of recent publications and new consumer education resources\, External Affairs staff will take questions from attendees. This event is designed for a non-technical audience to learn about ISO New England and is free and open to the public. Attendees are welcome to drop in any time during the office hours.\n\nFor more information on ISO New England\, see our We Are ISO video. The ISO’s External Affairs department maintains regular communication with state regulators and policymakers\, state and federal legislators\, governors\, attorneys general and consumer representatives in the six states served by ISO New England to provide information on the wholesale electricity markets and regional power system.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nThis event will be held virtually via Teams:\n\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/295598082661005?p=52qQCDxzK76NpwF2i7\n\nMeeting ID: 295 598 082 661 005\n\nPasscode: LG7YJ6tA\nContact: Kerry Schlichting (kschlichting@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165301
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165301
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:160379@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261005T135909Z
DTSTART:20261027T120000Z
DTEND:20261027T200000Z
SUMMARY:Navigating the Energy Markets (NavEM) in New England (Day 1 of 3)
LOCATION:ISO New England\, 1 Sullivan Road\, Holyoke\, MA 01040 [Connecticut Training Room\, Sullivan South (2nd floor)]
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a comprehensive three-day\, hands-on course designed to delve into advanced topics in New England’s energy market. This course is open to all power industry professionals seeking a deeper understanding of energy market operations and complexities. It is highly recommended that anyone wishing to take this course complete the New England’s Wholesale Energy Market course prior to enrolling. \n\nRegister Now!\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160379
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160379
END:VEVENT
